<%- layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="page-wrapper">

  <!-- header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      Please read these terms carefully before using BookLoop.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- content -->
  <section class="page-content">

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">1. About BookLoop</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        BookLoop is a student-to-student platform that allows users to
        exchange, sell, or donate textbooks. BookLoop only acts as a
        medium to connect users.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">2. User Responsibility</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        Users are responsible for the accuracy of the information they
        provide, including book details, condition, pricing, and location.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">3. Transactions</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        All exchanges, sales, or donations happen directly between users.
        BookLoop is not responsible for payments, delivery, or disputes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">4. Content & Conduct</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        Users must not post misleading, illegal, or inappropriate content.
        BookLoop reserves the right to remove any content that violates
        platform guidelines.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">5. Changes to Terms</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        BookLoop may update these terms from time to time. Continued use
        of the platform means acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

</main>